## Security Notes

- Passwords are handled by Supabase Auth and are never stored in plain text.
- Row Level Security policies make sure users can only read and change their own orders.
- Only the public anon key is used in the browser; secret keys are never exposed.
- Secrets live in `.env`, which is excluded from version control.

